{
    "title": "MiLB",
    "description": "The MiLB app is your official companion for Minor League Baseball, including all 120 clubs, from Triple-A to Single-A. Get free comprehensive coverage tailored to your favorite teams: live scores, stats, news, rosters, and more video highlights than ever this year.\r\n\r\n- Log in with your MLB account and find your MiLB team with personalized recommendations.\r\n- Manage your tickets directly from the teams tab at participating clubs.\r\n- Get quick access to schedules, tickets, and the latest news for your favorite team.\r\n- Follow the action with pitch-by-pitch updates on Gameday, along with live scores, stats, video highlights and notifications for all 120 teams.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIBE & GET EVEN MORE\r\n\r\nMore than 7,000 live MiLB games and complete archives are available with your At Bat subscription. Your At Bat subscription now includes audio streams for all MLB games & other live programming, available with log-in on MLB App and MLB.com.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.milb.com/about/terms \r\nCopyright \u00a9 2024 Minor League Baseball.\r\nMinor League Baseball trademarks and copyrights are the property of Minor League Baseball. All Rights Reserved.\r\n\r\nBlackout restrictions:\r\nBlackout restrictions may apply for Lehigh Valley IronPigs home games. Other restrictions may apply. Visit MiLB.TV for details.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The MiLB app is your official companion for Minor League Baseball, including all 120 clubs, from Triple-A to Single-A. Get free comprehensive coverage tailored to your favorite teams: live scores, stats, news, rosters, and more video highlights than ever this year.<br><br>- Log in with your MLB account and find your MiLB team with personalized recommendations.<br>- Manage your tickets directly from the teams tab at participating clubs.<br>- Get quick access to schedules, tickets, and the latest news for your favorite team.<br>- Follow the action with pitch-by-pitch updates on Gameday, along with live scores, stats, video highlights and notifications for all 120 teams.<br><br>SUBSCRIBE &amp; GET EVEN MORE<br><br>More than 7,000 live MiLB games and complete archives are available with your At Bat subscription. Your At Bat subscription now includes audio streams for all MLB games &amp; other live programming, available with log-in on MLB App and MLB.com.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.milb.com/about/terms <br>Copyright \u00a9 2024 Minor League Baseball.<br>Minor League Baseball trademarks and copyrights are the property of Minor League Baseball. All Rights Reserved.<br><br>Blackout restrictions:<br>Blackout restrictions may apply for Lehigh Valley IronPigs home games. Other restrictions may apply. Visit MiLB.TV for details.",
